{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Webhook Delivery Engine \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HWebhook Delivery Engine\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nThe outbox claims an event with a lease, signs its ID, timestamp and exact bytes, then retries with bounded exponential delay. The receiver persists a unique event ID and payload hash.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HWebhook Delivery Engine\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:18.256219+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0136,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"outage\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"invoice-42\",\r\n      \"state\": \"retry\",\r\n      \"attempts\": 1,\r\n      \"error\": \"HTTP 503\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"recovery\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"invoice-42\",\r\n      \"state\": \"delivered\",\r\n      \"attempts\": 2,\r\n      \"error\": null\r\n    },\r\n    \"events\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"invoice-42\",\r\n        \"state\": \"delivered\",\r\n        \"attempts\": 2,\r\n        \"error\": null\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
